  "interpretation": [
    "These selected cases preserve a capability, not a claim of universal improvement or maximum server capacity. The original comparison also included automatic/manual, dense and spatial controls.",
    "Development services remained active. Parts of snapshot repetitions 0/1 overlapped another headless browser workload; it ended before repetition 2. Small timing differences should not be treated as precise limits.",
    "All four Jigsaw runs passed verification and sustained generator cadence. They were not generator-limited; the separately recorded maintainer observation about bot saturation is not measured by these runs.",
    "Core before/after output byte and operation counts agreed. A separate lifecycle probe produced identical encoded bytes, and decode/apply integration checks validated channel behavior.",
    "This is a compact evidence extract, not a complete source archive. Exact historical runners, raw results and source snapshots remain in the original workspace archive."
